    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. One of the biggest worries right now is potential \"hidden\" liabilities—like, if there are assets or properties that weren't immediately obvious or that haven't been fully disclosed in previous filings, how does that change things? What's the risk if a tax authority finds something we didn't realize was there?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
