      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Hidden assets discovered during an inheritance tax review can lead to significant penalties, interest on unpaid taxes, and criminal charges for tax evasion in severe cases, regardless of intent. Most jurisdictions strictly audit estates for undervalued properties or unreported bank accounts if the initial filing appears incomplete. To mitigate this risk, it is crucial to conduct a comprehensive, transparent inventory of all global assets and consult with an international tax specialist immediately.",
      "source": "target",
